After two successful predictions, my trades closed in profit and I no longer hold any short-term positions on </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://x.com/hashtag/BTC">#BTC</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">. You can verify this from the notes on the chart or reposts.

While the price continues to consolidate within the range, it has found a solid reaction from the OTE zone located in the discount area of the range.

Upon a break above the EQ zone, the problematic area, which is the PWO-WO interval ($68,300–$69,000), will come into play. There is a possibility that it acts as short-term resistance. Unless a decisive breakout of that zone is observed, the price will continue to chop around within this range.

In the meantime, as I highlighted in previous reports, </span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$BTC.D">$<!-- -->BTC.D</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> getting rejected from the red box and declining toward the 58.1% level has prevented altcoins from making a new low. The short-term levels I am currently monitoring are 58.1% and 58.8%.

Tomorrow, I will be back with the HTF &amp; LTF analyses of </span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$BTC">$<!-- -->BTC</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">, </span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$ETH">$<!-- -->ETH</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">, </span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$ETHBTC">$<!-- -->ETHBTC</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">, and </span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$BTC.D">$<!-- -->BTC.D</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">, which will be published in the research report. 
